# rollcall.trk -- "Roll Call": a breakbeat etude for sub-row timing.
# One row per (swung) sixteenth: a bar of drums, then a 10-bar loop.
#   x@.15   a laid-back snare (lands 15% of a row late)
#   x*3     a ratchet: three hits inside one row
#   x?.5    a ghost that plays on about half the passes (seed: picks which)
#   off@.5  a note cut halfway through the row
# Everything else is the ordinary tracker.

track kick  note vel
track snare note vel
track hat   note vel
track ohat  note vel
track bass  note vel

pattern beat 16 kick snare hat ohat
lane kick  9... .... ..8. ....
lane hat   7.4. 7.4. 7.4. 7...
lane ohat  .... .... .... ..6.
01 | . | .        | x?.5 .3          # ghost hats: a different groove each pass
04 | . | x@.15 .95                   # backbeat sits behind the grid
09 | . | .        | x*2 .5
11 | . | x?.4 .25                    # ghost snare
12 | . | x@.15 1
13 | . | .        | x?.5 .3

# the turnaround: hat ratchets, then a snare roll that speeds up into bar 1
pattern turn 16 kick snare hat ohat
lane kick  9... .... ..8. ....
lane hat   7.4. 7... .... ....
04 | . | x@.15 .95
06 | . | .           | x*3 .55
08 | . | x .7
10 | . | x*2 .6>
12 | . | x*3 .
13 | . | x*3 .
14 | . | x*4 .
15 | . | x*4 1       | .   | x .7

pattern bass 2x16 bass
1:00 | E1 .9
1:03 | off@.5
1:06 | E1@.5 .7                     # pushed half a row late
1:08 | G1 .8
1:10 | off@.5
1:14 | A1 .8
2:00 | E1 .9
2:03 | off@.5
2:08 | D2 .8
2:09 | off@.5
2:10 | B1 .7
2:12 | A1 .8
2:15 | off@.5

section main bass+beat
section tail bass+beat+turn@16

order beat                          # one bar of drums alone
order |: main*2 tail main^5 tail^5
